{"id":"vod_jy_44003","vodId":"44003","provider":"jy","providerName":"金鹰资源","type":2,"name":"中二病也要谈恋爱","name_cn":"中二病也要谈恋爱","date":"2012-01-01","year":"2012","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日本动漫","remarks":"第13集完结","images":{"common":"https://image.jinyingimage.com/cover/224400c2e26393536a7a306a636f5287.jpg"},"summary":"顺利升入高中的少年富樫勇太（福山润 配音）在初中时代曾是暗黑系的中二病患者，当年他自称黑炎之主人，自我感觉良好地度过了无厘头的中学生活。但是此刻他“痛改前非”，将这段经历看作不堪回首的耻辱过去，为此甚至不惜报考一个离家很远没有人认识自己的高中。在新的学校，勇太如愿以偿结 交了一色诚（保志总一朗 配音）、丹生谷森夏（赤崎千夏 配音）以及学姐五月七日茴香（浅仓幸美 配音）这样稍显正常的朋友，也准备和心仪的女孩大谈一场浪漫恋爱。但是令他备为挠头的是，楼上新搬来的住户兼同班同学小鸟游六花（内田真礼 配音）却是一个中二病的深度患者。小女孩每天唧唧歪歪，怪力乱神。好不容易摆脱初中阴影的勇太，高中恋爱之梦日渐飘渺……","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-06-05 15:35:02","playable":true,"episodeCount":13,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"jinyingm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/vbmkGJre/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/7e5M35ve/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/Le33OWxe/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/xbom7q3e/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/Pe9jO4Za/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/QbYZ0Gnd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/negy6g3b/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/NbW1m4ve/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/0dNGp4pe/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/oeEyG40e/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/7axy9Xqb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/vbmkGvOe/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集完结","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/9avwDVXb/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T11:56:50.472Z"}